       "en": "**The future (remember your old habit!):** a plan you already decided → “I**’m going to** call my mom tonight.” A fixed appointment → “I**’m meeting** Jess at five.” A decision right now, a promise or an offer → “I**’ll** get it!” “I**’ll** call you later.” Never “Tonight I go to call…” or “Tomorrow I go to the dentist” for a plan: say “I’m going to the dentist tomorrow.”",
